  "body": "## What changed\n\nThe cross-drill holder check on box stock reads the stock along the holder's own swept footprint on each station, not the corner circle.\n\n- On a move that stays on one station (along its hole line, across it, or in Z, with the pose on an X or Y axis), `cross_holder` reads the stock and part in the tube the holder sweeps. A box counts at its face; a turned round still counts at its circumscribed radius, like the drill's entry. If the tube meets no material, the holder is clear.\n- The corner-radius reading in the holder's Z band is kept for swings around the bar (quarter-turn station changes) and for any off-axis pose.\n- In `cross_entry.rs`, tube clipping takes separate across and Z half-widths, and there's a new `tube_reach`; the drill entry's own arithmetic is unchanged. The new `drill_station.rs` holds the on-station test and builds the part-plus-stock mesh. `drill_reach.rs` is 355 lines and `cross_entry.rs` 364.\n- The station-move refusal now reads \"...stands X mm out along its hole's line, inside the stock's radius N on that line at Z ...\".\n\n## Pins\n\n- `drilling_cross_holder::a_holder_clearing_the_box_face_but_not_its_corner_circle_generates_and_posts` (60 box, holder face at x37): **fails on main** (\"inside the stock's radius 42.426\").\n- `drilling_cross_holder::a_holder_meeting_material_in_its_footprint_on_box_stock_is_refused_by_name`\n- `drill_reach::tests::an_on_station_holder_reads_the_box_at_its_face_not_its_corner_circle`: **fails on main**\n- `drill_reach::tests::a_swing_round_the_bar_keeps_the_corner_radius`\n\n## Readings\n\ndrill_reach 6, drill_reach_fit 3, drilling_cross 9, _box 7 (round-bar fingerprints unchanged), _holder 2, _part 3, _rapids 2, _spindle 6, _stock 8, lathe_cross_drill 5, lathe_spindle_fit/keyed/law 3/3/8, posting 17, lib 76; clippy on app is clean.\n\nChangelog: Cross drill on box stock: the holder is read along its own footprint on each station (a box at its face), keeping the corner radius only for swings around the bar, so a holder that clears the face is no longer refused\n\nFixes #119\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
